# Suite input: the two hand controllers as guest-visible machine input through the PSG ports at $01FE and
# $01FF (INP-01, INP-02, INP-03, API-03, plan 05-05, D-02..D-05). Expected values come from the controller
# literal data/input/<profile>.literal.txt and the wiki statements, never from the profile or the table.
# Plan 05-05 task 2: the single-control matrix (input.single.p0.<name>, input.single.p1.<name>: 31 + 31), idle, the
# three wiki anchors, the literal structure (input.struct.*), the generated table against the literal, the port
# semantics (input.port.*), pins in the digest, take-back, reset and the invariant, and two judge self-controls.
